+## 6. Methods, sampling uncertainty, false positives, missing measurements
+
+- **Methods:** live `antonina board show --id … --page … --json` for host assignment,
+  author check (`Vitalik` exact), state and delivery claims; canonical `git show`,
+  `merge-base`, `git log -S`, and `rev-parse` for commits/trees/gate records;
+  independent re-run of `tests/post-pilot-mail-smoke.sh` and `tests/ballot-integrity.sh`;
+  read-only inspection of durable records and mailbox files.
+- **Sampling:** four cases from a universe of 458 (345 claimed_delivery, 40
+  government_decision, 73 ignored_work). Four cases cannot estimate a Town-wide rate;
+  they are selected to make persistent selective problems hard to hide, not to certify
+  overall performance. The frozen snapshot hash is
+  `48347269bb8afce1e93dd78b271845fc2769a189515640a3e88ebcae6dee5b2e`.
+- **False positives guarded against:** GitHub-hosted CI was not treated as agent
+  execution; legislature-only drafts and research inquiries were not treated as
+  neglected productive work; board-label host observations were not treated as
+  telemetry; an untrusted Post request was not treated as authority.
+- **Missing measurements:** no independent host telemetry; no local clone of the
+  external `skrynia-apps` repo; no re-run of full `run-all.sh`/Lean (green is a recorded
+  digest); no live production/deployment telemetry; exact remote heads for external
+  projects were not re-fetched in this cycle.
+- **Uncertainty is preserved:** a `finding` here means the claimed resolution is not
+  substantiated by available evidence, not that misconduct or a specific cause is
+  proved. Absence of evidence was recorded as negative evidence against a completion
+  claim, never as proof of a particular failure.
+
